# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Adjustments made 2026-10-28 when this snapshot was converted from a nested
# git repository (gitlink) into ordinary files tracked directly by the parent
# sell_manager_CLI repository.
#
# The original rules above are still honoured. The following negations only
# re-include the dated snapshot's own source/test/metadata files and its real
# documentation, which have no other home in the parent repository.
#
# Still deliberately ignored: config/cache/, config/assigned_ma.csv,
# config/*.secret, config/*.key, logs/, .env*, secrets.yml, *.log
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!src/sellmanagement.egg-info/
!src/sellmanagement.egg-info/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!docs/
!docs/PRD_sell_manager_CLI.md
!docs/Public_prep_AUDIT_REPORT.md
!docs/refactor_audit.md
!docs/samples/
!docs/samples/README.md
!docs/samples/sanitized_logs.jsonl
!how to structure project.txt
# Re-ignore Python bytecode caches that the broad negations above would
# otherwise re-include.
__pycache__/
!__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/**
*.py[cod]